	16-bit floating point modes and signed/unsigned integers.
	(floatuns<GPR:mode><FP16_HW:mode>2): Likewise.
	(fix_trunc<FP16_HW:mode><GPR:mode>): Likewise.
	(fixuns_trunc<FP16_HW:mode><GPR:mode>2): Likewise.

